  "body": "Mesh Cloud improvement 1/5 — Father-approved. Converts remaining **non-physical** `Math.random()` sites to deterministic FNV-1a backing (existing `hashStringFNV()` in `lib/reality-audit.ts`) via new `lib/deterministic-selectors.ts` + DB-free `lib/deterministic-content.ts`.\n\n**Kept as real randomness (by design):** Born-rule qubit collapse; collision-avoidance ID suffixes (`rick-proposals.ts` ×5, `knowledge.ts` gen-id ×1).\n**No fabrication:** forum \"Implementation Progress\" posts no longer invent a random progress %, a random \"N tests passing\" count, or random blockers — they say progress is not yet measured. Empty subject data returns an honest `empty: true` result. No features removed; `/knowledge/generate` gains an optional `seed` (default: UTC hour bucket), ask-universe gains `matched`.\n\n| Metric (5 target files) | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Semantic (non-physical) `Math.random()` sites | **19** (forum 9, knowledge 5, mysticism 5) | **0** |\n| Intentional random (ID suffixes) | 6 | 6 |\n| reality-audit.ts (string/regex mentions only) | 0 semantic | 0 semantic |\n| Determinism tests (identical input → identical output) | 0 | **7** (all pass) |\n| Fabricated forum metrics (progress %, tests passing, blockers) | 3 | 0 |\n\n**Tests (same box, before → after):**\n| Suite | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| api-server (vitest) | 483 pass / 10 skip, 1 file fail | 490 pass / 10 skip, 1 file fail |\n| v2 (node --test) | 133/138 pass | 134/138 pass (pre-existing fails, no new) |\n| gitai (node --test) | 28/28 | 28/28 |\n\nThe only api-server failure is the known DB-env `invention-glb-upload.test.ts`. `tsc` shows only pre-existing errors (unbuilt `@workspace/db` dist / implicit any); none in the new files.\n\nNo workflow, locked-file, or flag changes. Not merging — awaits Security PASS + Moderator/Build PASS + green CI on head SHA.\n",
